cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "CamTrap Measure: Distance Estimation of White-Tailed Deer in Camera-Trap Photos"
version: "0.3.0"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/toqitahamid/camtrap-measure"
abstract: >-
  CamTrap Measure is a Windows desktop app that gives the distance to each
  white-tailed deer in camera-trap photos. It combines MegaDetector, SpeciesNet
  and a reference-conditioned distance network to give each animal a distance
  with a 90% interval.
keywords:
  - camera traps
  - wildlife
  - distance estimation
  - white-tailed deer
  - MegaDetector
